[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1021","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1021.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1245","title":"UCD ucd-snmp SNMP 服务器信息泄露漏洞","description":"ucd-snmp 3.52 版本的 vacm 模块存在访问控制缺陷，未正确禁用对默认 public 团体字符串的访问权限。远程攻击者无需认证即可利用该漏洞通过 SNMP 协议读取目标系统上的敏感配置信息，导致信息泄露。该漏洞影响 ucd-snmp 3.52 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1245"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-04-06T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:01Z","remediation":"升级 ucd-snmp 至 3.6 或更高版本（该漏洞已在 3.6 中修复），后续版本已更名为 net-snmp，建议迁移至 net-snmp 最新版。如无法升级，修改 snmpd.conf 将默认 public community 改为复杂字符串，并添加 `com2sec notConfigUser default \"\"` 禁用 public 访问，同时通过防火墙限制 SNMP（UDP 161/162）仅允许受信管理端 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/2086","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50269681ee58c9b5bf7169b73546eef94697389c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1245.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1245","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1245.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1245.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fpj3-2577-2q59/GHSA-fpj3-2577-2q59.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1245.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153400_153500.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000598.txt","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","http